					"nextDialogs": [
						726770716,
						726770717,
						726770718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770716,
					"content": "保护自己的时候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770719
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726770719,
					"content": "呶…虽然不是很明白，不过，我答应派蒙。不欺负弱小，也不随便打架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770720,
					"content": "嗯，吉法师真乖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726770721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726770721,
					"content": "接下来…应该就是五百藏决定的，去八个地方修行的最后一站了呢…",
