					"id": 726771025,
					"content": "嗯，一笔一笔把自己心里想的东西画出来，很辛苦的事情呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771026,
					"content": "嗯…那给我拍照，是不是很容易、不辛苦，所以没有很多心意？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771027
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771027,
					"content": "欸！不是这样的，是因为…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771028
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771028,
					"content": "画画要好长时间。吉法师会累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771029
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771029,
					"content": "对对！画画要好长时间的，吉法师要是一直保持一个姿势，会很累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771030
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771030,
					"content": "以前被封印变成石头的时候，就一直站着。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771031
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771031,
					"content": "所以，挣脱封印以后，好长时间里，脚好难受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771032,
					"content": "呜哇，听起来就觉得好辛苦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771033
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771033,
					"content": "但是，派蒙可以飞飞。应该脚不会累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771034,
					"content": "喂！飞的时候，全身的幻肢都在运动，很累的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771035,
					"content": "哇！着火的花！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771036,
					"content": "好好听人说话啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771037,
					"content": "烈焰花？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771038
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771038,
					"content": "对喔，在镇守之森好像确实没怎么见过烈焰花…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771039
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771039,
					"content": "吉法师想要吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771040
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771040,
					"content": "想要！看上去很暖和。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771041
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771041,
					"content": "#那要好好拜托{NICKNAME}喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771042
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771042,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，想要。谢谢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771043
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771043,
					"content": "…感觉也不是很有诚意。还是说，妖狸说话就是这种风格…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771021,
					"content": "因为留影机很贵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771022
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771022,
					"content": "欸？！留影机很贵吗？那平时战斗、游泳、爬山，又从山上掉下来会不会弄坏…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771023
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771023,
					"content": "呜哇，不得了，以后要小心才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726771006,
					"content": "像风元素？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726771007
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726771008,
					"content": "吉法师的词汇量和派蒙一样丰富…",
